                            <comment id="16710003" author="slukyanov" created="Wed, 5 Dec 2018 12:26:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=SomeFire&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;SomeFire&quot;&gt;SomeFire&lt;/a&gt;, if exception is not thrown we hit fail(&quot;No CacheException emitted.&quot;);. Am I missing something?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16711237" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 6 Dec 2018 10:19:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slukyanov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slukyanov&quot;&gt;slukyanov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
