&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&quot;Cache not found&quot; should be replaced with something like &quot;Cache has been destroyed concurrently&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;We should pass cache name instead of cache ID is possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16713111" author="slukyanov" created="Fri, 7 Dec 2018 17:25:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vozerov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vozerov&quot;&gt;vozerov&lt;/a&gt;, changing the message to &quot;Cache not found on local node (was concurrently destroyed?) &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;cacheId=%d&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&quot;. Is it fine with you?&lt;br/&gt;
